  "about": {
    "num": "01",
    "num_label": "the voice",
    "title_line1": "Still *early days*, and honestly?",
    "title_line2_ink": "that's the fun part.",
    "paragraphs": [
      "I'm Ananth — a Kuala Lumpur based emcee just at the start of the road. A dozen or so events in, mostly around Universiti Malaya, community bodies and government programmes. Not a veteran. Not pretending to be one.",
      "What I bring is *energy the room can feel*, three languages I can jump between, and a slightly-comedian instinct that keeps things warm even when the run-sheet gets serious."
    ],
    "quote": {
      "text": "You seem natural with audience interaction !",
      "source": "Most Received Feedback"
    },
